<title>GERMANY: D. Telekom details sales by unit, service.</title>
<headline>D. Telekom details sales by unit, service.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Telekom AG details sales by unit and service (in millions of marks, unless noted):</p>
<p>				    1996	    1995	   Pct</p>
<p>								     change</p>
<p>  Group sales		   63,100	  59,600	 5.9</p>
<p>of which:</p>
<p>    Telephony		   44,500	  44,300	+0.5</p>
<p>    Text/data, leased lines  4,500	   4,100	+9.8</p>
<p>    Terminal equipment	 4,200	   4,000	+5.0</p>
<p>    Other services	     1,200	     900     +33.3</p>
<p>    Mobile tel service	 3,700	   3,100     +19.4</p>
<p>    Cable, broadcasting	3,100	   3,200	-3.1</p>
<p>    Int'l activities	   1,900	     n/a	 n/a</p>
</text>
